WEBVTT

00:00:39.230 --> 00:00:41.010
Thanks for the food!

00:00:42.270 --> 00:00:43.990
Yeah, it's delicious.

00:03:00.920 --> 00:03:03.250
What's the matter, Keiichi-san?

00:03:05.170 --> 00:03:07.660
The amusement park is finally closing down.

00:03:07.970 --> 00:03:11.130
I believe we've gone there together before.

00:03:11.130 --> 00:03:12.480
Yeah, we have.

00:03:12.480 --> 00:03:15.240
Why are they closing down?

00:03:15.240 --> 00:03:20.170
It says that they've experienced a decline in visitors and they've worn-out their equipment.

00:03:20.170 --> 00:03:21.680
I see...

00:03:22.080 --> 00:03:29.140
I hope all the amusement park rides have fulfilled their duty to bring fun to people's lives.

00:03:32.140 --> 00:03:33.630
Why don't we go?

00:03:34.260 --> 00:03:36.190
One last time, on their final day.

00:03:37.060 --> 00:03:39.340
They're going to have fireworks on their last day.

00:03:39.340 --> 00:03:41.330
We happen to be closed that day,

00:03:41.330 --> 00:03:43.430
so why don't we go out since it's been a while?

00:03:44.580 --> 00:03:45.560
Sure!

00:04:13.560 --> 00:04:15.580
We've had absolutely no calls

00:04:15.580 --> 00:04:21.940
to the Earth Assistance Center for a full thirty minutes after 12:43.

00:04:22.490 --> 00:04:26.140
When I did a little research, I found that this was true for the Goddess Relief Office as well.

00:04:26.140 --> 00:04:28.080
And it's still occurring intermittently.

00:04:28.360 --> 00:04:29.710
That's a good thing.

00:04:29.710 --> 00:04:34.070
Does that mean Onee-sama doesn't have to be with Keiichi anymore?

00:04:34.070 --> 00:04:35.870
Why are you so relaxed about this?

00:04:36.960 --> 00:04:42.180
If humans think they've got nothing more to wish for from the goddesses,

00:04:42.180 --> 00:04:47.190
then the purpose for our existence on Earth will be gone.

00:04:47.720 --> 00:04:49.600
That's serious business!

00:04:49.600 --> 00:04:51.390
That's what I've been saying!

00:04:51.850 --> 00:04:54.430
In that case, what's causing it?

00:04:56.340 --> 00:04:57.400
That's...

00:04:59.710 --> 00:05:03.650
Basically, the Happiness Energy emitted from Belldandy

00:05:03.650 --> 00:05:08.780
has scattered happiness particles around Earth and filled people with happiness.

00:05:08.780 --> 00:05:11.800
That's what I've been trying to tell you!

00:05:11.800 --> 00:05:13.880
That's my Belldandy.

00:05:13.880 --> 00:05:18.450
To think she'd bring happiness to not just Keiichi, but all of mankind.

00:05:18.450 --> 00:05:21.300
And? What's so wrong about that?

00:05:21.880 --> 00:05:24.670
That's what I wondered at first too, but...

00:05:31.470 --> 00:05:34.180
You're all clean now, Mr. Potato.

00:05:35.060 --> 00:05:37.190
She's the same as usual.

00:05:37.190 --> 00:05:40.950
How exactly did she emit the Happiness Energy?

00:05:40.950 --> 00:05:43.570
If it's not Belldandy...

00:05:44.830 --> 00:05:46.280
Keiichi?!

00:05:47.780 --> 00:05:49.910
I-It's true!

00:05:49.910 --> 00:05:53.610
Then what is it? Are you saying you merely asked her out on a date?

00:05:53.610 --> 00:05:55.590
Umm... not exactly a date...

00:05:55.590 --> 00:05:59.670
But, yeah, I guess it could be considered a date.

00:05:59.670 --> 00:06:00.810
Stop acting sappy!

00:06:01.400 --> 00:06:02.680
This is bad.

00:06:06.800 --> 00:06:10.340
Mr. Carrot, you're all clean now too.

00:06:15.990 --> 00:06:19.160
I've accessed the Yggdrasil system.

00:06:19.160 --> 00:06:22.360
It appears the Happiness Energy value is stable for now.

00:06:22.920 --> 00:06:27.760
As long as we can write a program that can manipulate Happiness Energy...

00:06:27.760 --> 00:06:29.530
Then everything will be okay.

00:06:29.530 --> 00:06:32.830
Writing such a program isn't that simple!

00:06:32.830 --> 00:06:34.910
My, aren't you confident?

00:06:34.910 --> 00:06:36.090
I know!

00:06:36.090 --> 00:06:39.650
All she has to do is turn down her date tomorrow!

00:06:39.650 --> 00:06:42.110
She doesn't have to go on a date with Keiichi.

00:06:42.110 --> 00:06:45.650
Do you plan to tell Belldandy about the Happiness Energy?

00:06:46.950 --> 00:06:52.430
You're basically telling her to suppress her love.

00:06:52.760 --> 00:06:54.200
That can't be...

00:06:54.200 --> 00:06:55.850
Isn't there something you can do?

00:06:55.850 --> 00:07:02.500
Although if she really does release her powers, I don't know if even I will be able to handle her.

00:07:02.500 --> 00:07:03.860
Urd...

00:07:05.820 --> 00:07:09.540
When her Happiness Energy is spread to the masses,

00:07:09.540 --> 00:07:12.400
we'll be the only ones who will be able to stop her.

00:07:12.400 --> 00:07:14.830
Did you just say "we"?

00:07:15.850 --> 00:07:18.360
So you're finally going to depend on me.

00:07:18.360 --> 00:07:19.890
Th-That's not true.

00:07:19.890 --> 00:07:23.410
I'm not depending on you. It's just that it's unavoidable this time...

00:07:22.390 --> 00:07:24.710
Fine. Fine. I hear you. I hear you.

00:07:25.290 --> 00:07:28.150
Either way, we'll go to the amusement park tomorrow too.

00:07:28.150 --> 00:07:30.480
Yeah! There's something we've got to do!

00:07:30.480 --> 00:07:33.470
Yup, we'll need to support her tomorrow.

00:07:33.470 --> 00:07:38.730
What if Keiichi closes in on Belldandy?

00:07:38.730 --> 00:07:39.520
What?!

00:07:39.520 --> 00:07:41.810
Like this.

00:07:43.190 --> 00:07:45.370
Stupid Urd!

00:07:46.410 --> 00:07:49.340
I guess this is no time to be teasing her.

00:07:49.890 --> 00:07:53.690
Skuld, you better finish it soon.

00:07:53.690 --> 00:07:55.320
I don't care anymore!

00:07:58.650 --> 00:08:03.190
It's been a while since I visited the amusement park with Belldandy... just the two of us.

00:08:04.140 --> 00:08:07.210
Hmm? When did we last go?

00:08:08.130 --> 00:08:14.730
Still, for some reason, I can clearly remember trying everything without getting anything.

00:08:15.130 --> 00:08:18.320
I hope we can enjoy it this time.

00:08:18.720 --> 00:08:22.740
But first, what does Belldandy think about it?

00:08:22.740 --> 00:08:24.730
What does she want to do tomorrow?

00:08:26.490 --> 00:08:29.690
What's happiness for Belldandy?

00:08:29.990 --> 00:08:32.640
I've never actually thought about it.

00:08:34.610 --> 00:08:37.490
Belldandy's happiness...

00:08:40.130 --> 00:08:41.020
Belldandy?

00:08:41.720 --> 00:08:43.460
What is it?

00:08:43.460 --> 00:08:46.020
I-I-It's about tomorrow.

00:08:46.020 --> 00:08:46.840
Yes?

00:08:48.080 --> 00:08:50.290
I sure hope the weather's nice tomorrow.

00:08:50.290 --> 00:08:51.770
Yes, I hope so too.

00:08:51.770 --> 00:08:55.130
If it's raining, they may cancel the fireworks.

00:08:55.130 --> 00:08:57.420
Is rain in the forecast tomorrow?

00:08:57.420 --> 00:08:59.760
Umm... that's not what I meant.

00:08:59.760 --> 00:09:03.790
A ridge of low pressure will surround the area tomorrow and, as a result, there will be rain.

00:09:03.790 --> 00:09:04.520
What?

00:09:04.520 --> 00:09:08.000
At this rate, they'll cancel the fireworks.

00:09:08.000 --> 00:09:09.210
Belldandy.

00:09:09.210 --> 00:09:10.020
Yes?

00:09:11.000 --> 00:09:12.860
A-About tomorrow...

00:09:13.240 --> 00:09:15.130
Yes, Keiichi-san?

00:09:15.130 --> 00:09:17.660
Tomorrow... tomorrow...

00:09:23.080 --> 00:09:26.010
Let's try not to sleep in tomorrow.

00:09:26.010 --> 00:09:27.370
Yes.

00:09:27.680 --> 00:09:33.390
I really hope the weather is nice for the amusement park's last day.

00:09:33.390 --> 00:09:36.120
Y-Yes, I hope so too.

00:09:36.120 --> 00:09:36.950
Yes!

00:09:36.950 --> 00:09:39.890
Wh-What do you want to do tomorrow, Belldandy?

00:09:39.890 --> 00:09:41.430
Me?

00:09:41.430 --> 00:09:42.910
Let's see...

00:09:43.630 --> 00:09:48.950
I would like to tell all the rides, "Thank you for your hard work."

00:09:48.950 --> 00:09:52.180
They've all worked hard for a very long time.

00:09:52.180 --> 00:09:56.060
I believe they'll tell me many stories.

00:09:57.340 --> 00:09:58.660
It's no good.

00:09:58.660 --> 00:10:01.910
I can't ask her what I want to know.

00:10:24.550 --> 00:10:26.430
Wow!

00:10:26.800 --> 00:10:29.790
We can't rely on the weatherman, can we?

00:10:29.790 --> 00:10:32.610
Looks like the weather's on our side too.

00:10:32.990 --> 00:10:33.870
Yes, it is.

00:10:36.020 --> 00:10:38.030
Onee-sama, please be careful.

00:10:38.030 --> 00:10:40.600
Please take care of the house while I'm away.

00:10:40.600 --> 00:10:42.220
Leave it to us.

00:10:42.220 --> 00:10:43.960
Then we'll be off.

00:10:43.960 --> 00:10:46.040
Have a nice trip!

00:10:46.040 --> 00:10:49.690
Onee-sama, be careful of Keiichi!

00:10:51.720 --> 00:10:52.790
All right.

00:10:52.790 --> 00:10:54.560
Start mission!

00:10:54.560 --> 00:10:55.630
Roger!

00:11:06.590 --> 00:11:07.460
Hild!

00:11:07.460 --> 00:11:09.120
Long time no see.

00:11:09.120 --> 00:11:11.060
Where are all of you off to?

00:11:11.370 --> 00:11:13.410
What business do you have here, appearing out of the blue?

00:11:13.410 --> 00:11:16.330
Sorry, but we don't have time to play with you right now.

00:11:16.330 --> 00:11:17.820
My, you sure talk big.

00:11:18.260 --> 00:11:21.280
Especially for my first visit to my daughter in a very long time.

00:11:21.280 --> 00:11:22.320
Lies.

00:11:22.720 --> 00:11:24.410
I bet you're plotting something again.

00:11:24.410 --> 00:11:25.900
Spill it!

00:11:25.900 --> 00:11:27.750
As expected from my daughter.

00:11:27.750 --> 00:11:28.790
You have good intuition.

00:11:29.130 --> 00:11:29.910
Oh no!

00:11:30.240 --> 00:11:31.660
Here, have this.

00:11:33.530 --> 00:11:35.710
I knew it. It was all your doing.

00:11:34.830 --> 00:11:36.350
It's cramped!

00:11:35.710 --> 00:11:37.300
You were the one who spread Belldandy's

00:11:36.350 --> 00:11:37.980
I hate being crammed in!

00:11:37.300 --> 00:11:38.940
Happiness Energy to the masses.

00:11:37.980 --> 00:11:38.940
I'm scared!

00:11:38.940 --> 00:11:44.770
Stay quiet in there until my plan is complete, okay?

00:11:38.940 --> 00:11:41.360
No, I hate being crammed in!

00:11:46.220 --> 00:11:49.530
Soon, this world won't need goddesses anymore.

00:11:49.530 --> 00:11:52.190
I shall send you back to the heavens.

00:11:52.190 --> 00:11:54.190
Stop it, Hild!

00:11:54.590 --> 00:12:00.210
All I want is for Bell-chan to enjoy her time with Keiichi-kun today.

00:12:03.700 --> 00:12:07.690
I hope you have the best date ever, Belldandy.

00:12:08.330 --> 00:12:09.700
Hild!

00:12:22.240 --> 00:12:24.430
Let's go inside, Belldandy.

00:12:24.430 --> 00:12:26.290
Yes, Keiichi-san.

00:12:26.290 --> 00:12:27.190
What do you want to do?

00:12:27.190 --> 00:12:29.470
Shall we revisit what we visited last time?

00:12:29.470 --> 00:12:31.240
Yes.

00:12:31.240 --> 00:12:33.600
In that case, this one!

00:12:36.480 --> 00:12:38.970
Hello, Mr. Rollercoaster.

00:12:38.970 --> 00:12:41.160
Please take me for a ride again.

00:12:41.160 --> 00:12:43.330
You bet'cha!

00:12:43.330 --> 00:12:47.140
Mr. Morisato, you better take care of her, baby!

00:12:47.140 --> 00:12:48.530
Y-Yes.

00:12:48.530 --> 00:12:50.240
I'll try my best.

00:12:56.950 --> 00:13:00.070
I-Isn't this a little too fast?!

00:13:02.020 --> 00:13:03.860
Thank you for all your hard work.

00:13:10.330 --> 00:13:14.430
"I'm glad a lot of people have enjoyed me for a long time."

00:13:14.430 --> 00:13:17.370
"I have no regrets", is what he says.

00:13:17.370 --> 00:13:18.440
I see.

00:13:18.820 --> 00:13:22.280
So he was able to satisfy his duty.

00:13:22.740 --> 00:13:23.750
Yes, he did.

00:13:50.790 --> 00:13:54.970
Maybe this is Belldandy's happiness.

00:13:58.670 --> 00:13:59.980
I had fun.

00:13:59.980 --> 00:14:01.850
So did I.

00:14:01.850 --> 00:14:05.060
It's been a while since I last rode them. It was exciting.

00:14:05.060 --> 00:14:06.240
You too?

00:14:06.240 --> 00:14:07.440
Yes.

00:14:07.440 --> 00:14:10.620
But you didn't mention anything like that last time.

00:14:10.620 --> 00:14:16.250
Back then, I was curious why humans made things like this.

00:14:17.050 --> 00:14:21.000
But now, I enjoy the excitement.

00:14:21.000 --> 00:14:21.790
What?

00:14:21.790 --> 00:14:27.730
I've come to understand the desire to be excited from time to time.

00:14:28.880 --> 00:14:32.650
Want to feel excited? You do?

00:14:33.190 --> 00:14:34.080
Yes, I do.

00:14:36.730 --> 00:14:37.880
Keiichi-san?

00:14:37.880 --> 00:14:39.520
Ah, yes?

00:14:39.520 --> 00:14:42.290
Can we visit a puppet show next?

00:14:43.720 --> 00:14:45.130
We can't?

00:14:45.130 --> 00:14:48.430
No, a puppet show sounds good.

00:14:48.920 --> 00:14:50.500
I'm glad.

00:14:50.500 --> 00:14:52.340
Then let's go.

00:14:52.340 --> 00:14:53.170
Okay.

00:14:55.290 --> 00:14:58.160
Do you remember this story?

00:14:58.160 --> 00:14:59.000
Hmm?

00:14:59.000 --> 00:15:04.220
A shy prince falls in love with a princess from his neighboring country.

00:15:04.220 --> 00:15:06.030
I-I don't remember it too well.

00:15:06.640 --> 00:15:11.550
But, no matter what he did, he was unable to confess his feelings.

00:15:11.550 --> 00:15:14.510
It was about him getting help from the Goddess of Love.

00:15:14.890 --> 00:15:15.700
What?

00:15:15.700 --> 00:15:18.070
Don't you think it's a sweet story?

00:15:18.070 --> 00:15:22.720
Especially when the prince confesses to the Goddess.

00:15:24.630 --> 00:15:27.320
I was a little excited.

00:15:27.950 --> 00:15:31.120
Belldandy was excited?

00:15:33.110 --> 00:15:34.930
It's going to start.

00:15:34.930 --> 00:15:36.280
Okay.

00:15:41.440 --> 00:15:46.090
Then, the Goddess of Love told the shy prince:

00:15:46.910 --> 00:15:50.190
It is easy for me to give you a hand.

00:15:50.190 --> 00:15:52.570
However, I don't think it's the right thing to do.

00:15:52.570 --> 00:15:53.460
What?

00:15:53.460 --> 00:15:58.890
Unless you convey the emotions yourself, they'll never reach her.

00:15:59.550 --> 00:16:05.960
You must let the princess know about the fluttering beat of your own heart.

00:16:05.960 --> 00:16:09.370
"T-The fluttering beat of your own heart"?

00:16:09.370 --> 00:16:13.180
But soon, the prince realized something.

00:16:14.500 --> 00:16:21.310
As the shy prince was receiving lessons from the Goddess of Love,

00:16:21.310 --> 00:16:24.670
he had fallen in love with her.

00:16:29.500 --> 00:16:31.580
G-Goddess of Love.

00:16:31.580 --> 00:16:33.500
Yes? What is it?

00:16:33.500 --> 00:16:37.750
I don't need your teachings anymore.

00:16:37.750 --> 00:16:38.810
What?!

00:16:42.990 --> 00:16:44.470
I understand.

00:16:44.470 --> 00:16:48.880
So you don't need me anymore.

00:16:48.880 --> 00:16:50.910
No. That's not it, Goddess of Love.

00:16:52.210 --> 00:16:56.910
You told me to convey the fluttering beat of my own heart.

00:17:00.100 --> 00:17:03.690
Right now, I can clearly convey it.

00:17:04.500 --> 00:17:07.770
Goddess, I love you!

00:17:07.770 --> 00:17:08.880
What?!

00:17:11.960 --> 00:17:13.400
Goddess!

00:17:13.990 --> 00:17:15.470
Prince!

00:17:15.960 --> 00:17:18.430
The fluttering heart...

00:17:22.450 --> 00:17:26.480
To clearly convey it... to Belldandy.

00:17:31.230 --> 00:17:32.720
Belldandy.

00:17:34.360 --> 00:17:35.740
Keiichi-san?

00:17:42.010 --> 00:17:43.370
Belldandy.

00:17:51.310 --> 00:17:53.130
Why did it turn out like this?

00:17:53.130 --> 00:17:57.770
At this stage, you'd normally do "this" and "that"!

00:17:57.770 --> 00:17:59.390
Geez!

00:18:02.990 --> 00:18:04.240
Take this!

00:18:04.940 --> 00:18:05.640
Hmm?

00:18:13.820 --> 00:18:15.220
The Arc de Triomphe!

00:18:15.220 --> 00:18:16.610
This is Paris!

00:18:16.610 --> 00:18:18.940
Hey, Skuld, hurry up.

00:18:18.940 --> 00:18:19.950
Don't rush me!

00:18:20.400 --> 00:18:23.890
I'm almost done inputting the release spell.

00:18:23.890 --> 00:18:24.700
All right.

00:18:28.340 --> 00:18:30.170
Skuld!

00:18:30.170 --> 00:18:33.520
Ah! My mini computer!

00:18:33.520 --> 00:18:34.250
That's enough.

00:18:34.250 --> 00:18:35.970
I've had enough.

00:18:35.970 --> 00:18:38.740
Don't! Not in here!

00:18:37.270 --> 00:18:38.740
Summon lightning!

00:18:46.050 --> 00:18:48.250
Hang on tight, Skuld.

00:18:48.250 --> 00:18:50.060
I'm going to step on it!

00:19:02.250 --> 00:19:05.300
Belldandy, would you like to ride the Ferris wheel?

00:19:07.330 --> 00:19:08.180
Sure.

00:19:14.820 --> 00:19:16.840
Can't this go any faster?

00:19:16.840 --> 00:19:18.700
No, you're too heavy.

00:19:18.700 --> 00:19:23.300
I'm not heavy. I've been manipulating gravity with my anti-gravity machine!

00:19:23.300 --> 00:19:26.080
Then that machine must be busted.

00:19:26.080 --> 00:19:28.780
You ought to be able to manipulate gravity using spells.

00:19:29.350 --> 00:19:30.240
Geez...

00:19:30.240 --> 00:19:32.520
Just hurry up!

00:19:38.400 --> 00:19:41.190
Huh? What was I just doing?

00:19:42.650 --> 00:19:46.040
Belldandy, did you have fun today?

00:19:46.040 --> 00:19:47.070
Yes, I did.

00:19:47.070 --> 00:19:49.680
I'm really happy to have met with

00:19:49.680 --> 00:19:55.120
each ride that accomplished its duty during the final day of the amusement park.

00:19:55.120 --> 00:19:57.300
Yes, I think so too.

00:19:57.670 --> 00:19:58.980
And...

00:20:00.020 --> 00:20:05.250
I'm also happy that you gave me an opportunity to do so.

00:20:05.250 --> 00:20:08.680
Keiichi-san, I really enjoyed it.

00:20:08.680 --> 00:20:10.160
Belldandy.

00:20:10.160 --> 00:20:13.780
Geez, why did it turn out like this?

00:20:18.190 --> 00:20:20.330
Are you all right, Belldandy?

00:20:20.330 --> 00:20:21.630
Let's go.

00:20:22.850 --> 00:20:24.360
To the Ferris wheel.

00:20:34.370 --> 00:20:38.810
Onee-sama's Happiness Energy is starting to go out of control!

00:20:40.340 --> 00:20:42.650
Wh-What should we do, Urd?

00:20:44.740 --> 00:20:46.920
To think that you've gotten past the barrier.

00:20:46.920 --> 00:20:48.480
I commend you.

00:20:48.480 --> 00:20:50.300
Move aside, Hild.

00:20:50.300 --> 00:20:51.480
It's too late.

00:20:51.820 --> 00:20:56.730
Now that people are filled with happiness, the goddesses have lost their reason to exist.

00:20:56.730 --> 00:20:59.030
This is not true happiness.

00:20:59.030 --> 00:21:02.490
They just believe they're happy due to the effects of the Happiness Energy.

00:21:02.490 --> 00:21:04.720
What's so wrong about that?

00:21:04.720 --> 00:21:08.010
If illusions are trustworthy, then they themselves are the truth.

00:21:08.010 --> 00:21:11.040
Isn't that what you people seek?

00:21:11.040 --> 00:21:14.120
I just finished it in one fell swoop.

00:21:14.120 --> 00:21:18.150
You have no right to alter people's lives!

00:21:16.360 --> 00:21:18.150
No, you can't, Urd!

00:21:19.540 --> 00:21:20.880
Later!

00:21:34.890 --> 00:21:36.150
Urd!

00:21:36.150 --> 00:21:39.190
Listen, bring Belldandy under control.

00:21:39.190 --> 00:21:41.650
I asked you to help me!

00:21:43.600 --> 00:21:46.280
What do you intend to do, exiling goddesses from Earth?

00:21:46.710 --> 00:21:51.050
In a world where Heaven holds 100% of the Earth's share, the demons are the useless ones!

00:21:51.050 --> 00:21:52.570
You know nothing.

00:21:52.570 --> 00:21:55.040
Humans seek the impossible.

00:21:55.040 --> 00:21:58.530
They <i>will </i> eventually seek the demons out for stimulation.

00:21:58.530 --> 00:22:02.820
It is then when we shall give them a world of stimulation and enjoyment.

00:22:02.820 --> 00:22:04.420
It sure is fun!

00:22:04.420 --> 00:22:06.930
Don't toy with people's hearts!

00:22:08.790 --> 00:22:10.430
I'm happy.

00:22:10.780 --> 00:22:15.200
As long as Belldandy is smiling, I want nothing more.

00:22:15.200 --> 00:22:19.840
As long as she's with me, I want nothing else.

00:22:19.840 --> 00:22:22.940
I can live with nothing else.

00:22:23.440 --> 00:22:26.000
Onee-sama! Keiichi!

00:22:26.000 --> 00:22:27.970
Come back to your senses!

00:22:28.820 --> 00:22:30.820
A-A barrier?

00:22:32.210 --> 00:22:34.330
You think so too, right, Belldandy?

00:22:35.440 --> 00:22:37.990
This is how we're happiest.

00:22:38.520 --> 00:22:41.880
We're wrapped in happiness right now.

00:22:39.550 --> 00:22:41.880
Wrapped in happiness.

00:22:42.730 --> 00:22:43.710
Hmm?

00:22:47.720 --> 00:22:49.590
Do you really think so?

00:22:50.290 --> 00:22:52.270
A world with just the one you love.

00:22:52.270 --> 00:22:54.710
A world with just the things you like.

00:22:54.710 --> 00:22:57.450
Can that really be called true happiness?

00:22:58.000 --> 00:23:01.580
Isn't happiness more appreciable when

00:23:01.580 --> 00:23:04.980
there are hard and sad times?

00:23:05.550 --> 00:23:09.940
Look at yourself before you met Belldandy.

00:23:09.940 --> 00:23:12.440
And when you first met.

00:23:12.440 --> 00:23:16.000
All the incidents you and Belldandy were involved in.

00:23:16.350 --> 00:23:19.380
Keiichi-kun, please remember.

00:23:20.260 --> 00:23:23.140
What is happiness to you and Belldandy?

00:23:23.550 --> 00:23:26.510
Happiness to Belldandy and I...

00:23:33.140 --> 00:23:37.670
I learned to love after meeting you, Keiichi-san.

00:23:38.330 --> 00:23:43.580
As a goddess, I was able to grow drastically thanks to that fact.

00:23:44.940 --> 00:23:52.070
Keiichi-san, you were the one who taught me to love everything in this world.

00:23:54.850 --> 00:23:59.380
To be with you is my happiness.

00:24:00.080 --> 00:24:04.840
To live life with you is my happiness.

00:24:06.600 --> 00:24:07.860
Keiichi-san.

00:24:09.570 --> 00:24:12.350
Keiichi-san, I love you.

00:24:16.990 --> 00:24:18.140
Belldandy!

00:24:19.110 --> 00:24:21.640
Belldandy, wake up!

00:24:21.640 --> 00:24:22.790
Belldandy!

00:24:22.790 --> 00:24:26.650
You are the only one I need.

00:24:25.560 --> 00:24:26.670
The one I love...

00:24:27.340 --> 00:24:33.190
The one I love is you because you always do everything with love.

00:24:33.190 --> 00:24:38.040
That's the Belldandy I love!

00:24:57.590 --> 00:24:58.990
Belldandy.

00:25:00.030 --> 00:25:01.380
Keiichi-san.

00:25:02.390 --> 00:25:03.920
Belldandy.

00:25:07.060 --> 00:25:08.850
Look, fireworks!

00:25:11.070 --> 00:25:14.430
Seems like Belldandy's Happiness Energy has settled down.

00:25:14.430 --> 00:25:17.910
Man, Keiichi-kun ruined my plan again.

00:25:17.910 --> 00:25:19.350
Of course he did.

00:25:19.580 --> 00:25:24.820
He's a man who was chosen by Belldandy, the best goddess amongst goddesses.

00:25:29.930 --> 00:25:31.840
It's beautiful.

00:25:32.800 --> 00:25:36.780
I'm glad the weather was clear today.

00:25:36.780 --> 00:25:41.720
Yeah, it's all thanks to you, Belldandy.

00:25:48.750 --> 00:25:50.360
We're home.

00:25:48.750 --> 00:25:50.360
We're home.

00:25:51.690 --> 00:25:53.580
What's wrong with the both of you?

00:25:53.580 --> 00:25:55.870
We're tired, of course.

00:25:55.870 --> 00:25:57.870
I'm at my limit.

00:25:58.420 --> 00:26:00.630
Did you do something today?

00:26:00.630 --> 00:26:03.040
I don't even have the energy to fight back.

00:26:03.040 --> 00:26:05.410
More importantly, here.

00:26:06.470 --> 00:26:09.540
The Futtsu Amusement Park Closing Souvenirs.

00:26:10.630 --> 00:26:14.710
I thought it was sad to part with all the rides, but...

00:26:14.710 --> 00:26:17.420
See? This is Mr. Roller Coaster.

00:26:17.420 --> 00:26:19.550
This is Mr. Coffee Cup.

00:26:19.550 --> 00:26:23.520
Mr. Merry-Go-Round and this is Hana-chan the elephant!

00:26:24.560 --> 00:26:25.690
Hmm?

00:26:27.060 --> 00:26:29.060
What's wrong with the both of you?

00:26:29.060 --> 00:26:32.780
You'll catch a cold if you sleep here.

00:26:32.780 --> 00:26:34.760
Against Belldandy...

00:26:34.760 --> 00:26:36.840
...we're no match...
